{
 "duration": 24.854,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Dana planned Utah in November and packed for the desert.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.417
  },
  {
   "text": "Then she reached Bryce Canyon.",
   "start": 3.617,
   "end": 5.119
  },
  {
   "text": "The rim sits at eight thousand feet,",
   "start": 5.369,
   "end": 7.289
  },
  {
   "text": "and after snow the trails can pack down into ice.",
   "start": 7.389,
   "end": 10.244
  },
  {
   "text": "Her sneakers slid on the first switchback.",
   "start": 10.444,
   "end": 12.412
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Pack warm layers and traction that straps over your boots.",
   "start": 12.862,
   "end": 17.002
  },
  {
   "text": "Check the park alerts for closed trails that morning.",
   "start": 17.252,
   "end": 19.928
  },
  {
   "text": "Now she walks the hoodoos under snow, steady.",
   "start": 20.328,
   "end": 22.596
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your Utah trip.",
   "start": 22.996,
   "end": 24.654
  }
 ],
